        "created_at": "2012-05-22T04:21:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So we were playing a game of SotM (as well you would expect) against the Chairman when a question arose (Duh!).</p>\n<p>What happens when the Chairman reaches 0 HP, you haven’t yet defeated the Operative and a card comes up either healing him or having him deal damage? Do you just ignore that portion of the card (like after Omnitron is defeated) or can he be resurrected and/or strike from beyond the grave?</p>\n<p>Thoughts were postulated but ultimately it didn’t matter because we got completely spanked by the Hired Gun doing 8 points of damage to each hero (Obsidian Field, the Contract and an advanced flipped Chairman do not make for a happy combination).</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:37.112Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
