        "id": 31174,
        "name": "josul0215",
        "username": "josul0215",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/josul0215/{size}/2621_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-23T02:03:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Actually, you still do play villain cards, even with Omnitron. However if a card involves the Chairman doing something, that effect doesn’t take place, like healing or hitting a hero.</p>\n<p>I believe the only thing that Omnitron’s deck can do when he’s dead is play more drones and Electropulse Device, any other card is sent to the trash without an effect like components and oneshots since he is already dead and can’t trigger them.</p>",
        "post_number": 9,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:05:08.346Z",
