        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/f05b48/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-24T01:59:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, playing a villain card happens each turn as a general effect not as an effect of the villains character card so it happens regardless. In Omitrons case he doesn’t get to play a second card or dredge the trash for a drone if he is removed from the game since that effect is written on his card.</p>",
